Feral Spirits Summoned
    Events
        Unit - A unit Spawns a summoned unit
    Conditions
        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                (Unit-type of (Summoned unit)) Equal to Spirit Wolf (Level 1)
                (Unit-type of (Summoned unit)) Equal to Dire Wolf (Level 2)
                (Unit-type of (Summoned unit)) Equal to Shadow Wolf (Level 3)
        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                (Owner of (Summoning unit)) Equal to Player 1 (Red)
                (Owner of (Summoning unit)) Equal to Player 20 (Lavender)
    Actions
        -------- Store Summoner and Wolf Information Using Custom Value --------
        Set VariableSet FeralSpirits_TempSummoner = (Summoning unit)
        Set VariableSet FeralSpirits_TempWolf = (Summoned unit)
        -------- Assign Summoner's Index to the Wolf --------
        Set VariableSet FeralSpirits_WolfCV = (Custom value of FeralSpirits_TempWolf)
        Set VariableSet FeralSpirits_SummonerCV = (Custom value of FeralSpirits_TempSummoner)
        -------- Store Summoner Data for This Wolf --------
        Set VariableSet FeralSpirits_Summoner[FeralSpirits_WolfCV] = FeralSpirits_TempSummoner
        -------- Add Wolf to Group for Tracking --------
        Unit Group - Add FeralSpirits_TempWolf to FeralSpirits_WolfGroup
        -------- --------------- --------
        Unit - Change ownership of FeralSpirits_TempWolf to Player 19 (Mint) and Retain color
        -------- Enable Follow Loop --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Feral Spirits Follow <gen> is on) Equal to False
            Then - Actions
                Trigger - Turn on Feral Spirits Follow <gen>
            Else - Actions
